    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tiredness, improving</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Sore tongue, improving</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or palpitations</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Breathless on one flight of stairs</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tingling in both feet; unsteady in the dark; no memory change</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low back ache after standing</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>6 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

